WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.086
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:26.968
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:29.468
will explain the four checks in plain language and

00:00:29.481 --> 00:00:33.902
identify the missing condition in a new request Outcomes

00:00:33.928 --> 00:00:37.560
linked to this activity Item 2 of 2 EA-01

00:00:37.626 --> 00:00:41.284
. 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities from those of a

00:00:41.363 --> 00:00:45.692
personal assistant office manager chief of staff and specialist

00:00:45.718 --> 00:00:50.546
adviser and refer work outside the agreed mandate Learning

00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:53.651
practice and acknowledgement are not an assessor result or

00:00:53.782 --> 00:00:55.256
workplace authorisation
